2026-09-04T06:10Z claude executed Fixed. `bench/acceptance/adapters/zoteus.py`'s `_env()` now redirects `HOME` and `TMPDIR` into arena-scoped directories (`self.home = arena / "home"`, `self.tmp = arena / "tmp"`, mirroring the sibling convention exactly) and blanks `XDG_CACHE_HOME`/`XDG_CONFIG_HOME`/`XDG_DATA_HOME`/`XDG_STATE_HOME`. `running()` creates both directories alongside the existing `data_dir.mkdir`. Diff is additive: no existing key in `_env()` changed. Footprint, tests, and red/green controls below; full detail in this ticket's body.

